    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 66B of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262) by the repeal of subsection (4) of that section and it is consequential to theamendments made to Municipal Council Ordinance (Chapter 252), Urban Councils Ordinance(Chapter 255) and Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of 1987, and the legal effect due to suchrepeal will be to revert back to the procedure followed by the Municipal Council, UrbanCouncil or Pradeshiya Sabha, prior to the Local Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act,No. 22 of 2012 when re-submitting a budget or supplementary budget to the MunicipalCouncil, Urban Council or Pradeshiys Sabha, as the case may be.",
